{
 "url": "/cn/zh/ideas/kaixue-pubd4052d01",
 "family": "ideas",
 "id": "cn--zh--d4052d013fbc11e79e89c585573d28c9",
 "title": "九条打包技巧，助你为开学做好准备",
 "name": "201643_idpl03a_PLEL_EZ_SEO",
 "hero": null,
 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "pub-hero",
   "title": "九条打包技巧，助你为开学做好准备",
   "texts": [
    "打包好靠在彩色墙面上的开学必需品",
    "<p>今年要去读大学了，正苦于不知道如何打包所有东西？我们来帮你。下面我们为你介绍几个很棒的建议，让你的开学必需品完好抵达宿舍。但它们能否平安度过你的第一个宿舍派对，那又是另一回事了……</p>",
    "九条打包技巧，助你为开学做好准备",
    "normal"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/21/9d/219d6e6f349f451bc1536d1c328e1c02.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/21/9d/219d6e6f349f451bc1536d1c328e1c02.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "将开学要带的必需品打包放进储物盒里",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/af/a3/afa37dadbe7453debf9dbd3e8c38ac35.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/af/a3/afa37dadbe7453debf9dbd3e8c38ac35.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>1.从化妆品到文具，</strong>在打包过程中，总会有一些易碎的小物件，很容易在运送过程中丢失（或遭受挤压）。我们的建议是把它们储存在贴有标签的盒子里加以保护。用内部设有储物格的盒子装小物件，也是一个不错的选择。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "将开学要带的食物打包成盒",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "90292358"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/39/84/398484b3b8e72215dfc5faba8589436a.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/39/84/398484b3b8e72215dfc5faba8589436a.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>2.住校的你肯定想</strong>&nbsp;从家里带些最喜欢的点心。我们的建议是把它们一起放入盒子里，这些盒子可以在你抵达宿舍后用作搁板或凳子。如果你预期旅途有点颠簸，可以在空隙处填放袜子或毛巾。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "宿舍所需床上用品可以包入椅腿间。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "60162301"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/e6/43/e6433075606786529244f8d4c7702a21.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/e6/43/e6433075606786529244f8d4c7702a21.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>3.我们有个非常简单的技巧！像被褥和枕头等大件纺织品</strong>&nbsp;可以用绳子或皮带压缩，然后塞到其他打包物品的空隙里，比如椅腿之间。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "去学校要穿的衣服鞋子，被装入了简易储物袋。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "80245881"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/16/a5/16a5f64e9622d6a6eca0a869700acfc9.gif"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/16/a5/16a5f64e9622d6a6eca0a869700acfc9.gif",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>4.在家收拾得越整齐</strong>，到校后拆封越容易。例如简易储物袋可以用来装衣物和鞋子，而且如果你把需要悬挂的衣服用衣架撑好，到校后就可以直接把衣服挂起来了（不过，也可以使用衣物保护袋，它们也会有所帮助。）</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "鞋子打包入宜家蓝色储物袋",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "20188483"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/95/ec/95ec3fa7362dd4155761b1d9d712fcea.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/95/ec/95ec3fa7362dd4155761b1d9d712fcea.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>5.打包大件物品，敞口袋子</strong>比储物箱和行李箱更适合。此外，这款袋子通常还可用作新洗衣篮或体育用品袋。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "书籍打包放入布袋",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/61/b4/61b4d91b6ee3b4e14b5800d72f2eb109.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/61/b4/61b4d91b6ee3b4e14b5800d72f2eb109.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>6.书籍同样适合</strong>&nbsp;用敞口袋子打包。而且在卸货和运送书籍到新宿舍时，你会非常感谢这样的打包方式，易于提拿。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "卷起来的画装入硬纸管中",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/c0/25/c02583012f77ca50699a5e2522862e0c.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/c0/25/c02583012f77ca50699a5e2522862e0c.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>7.打印的照片和画最能彰显你的个性了，不妨把它们带到新宿舍</strong>。你可以把它们装进硬纸管或卷起来用纸包好，避免弄皱。我们还有个特别的建议：用衣架或夹子来挂它们，这样就不需要画框了。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "把像笔记本电脑这样的开学必需品装入背包",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "20318432"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/53/50/53500306804da8e61a6dd553e8814364.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/53/50/53500306804da8e61a6dd553e8814364.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>8.将所有贵重物品都装入随身背包准没错</strong>。比如你的笔记本电脑、大学录取通知书、钥匙和文件。这样一到校，你就可以去办理入学手续了。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "家人为即将上大学的孩子准备的爱心包裹。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "50326510"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/00/c1/00c103208695506520fefc88f0482249.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/00/c1/00c103208695506520fefc88f0482249.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>9.现在你已经准备好了所有开学必需品</strong>，但最重要是别忘了“父母爱心包裹”。里面装有各种其他必需品和容易忘记的物品，牙刷、暖和的厚袜子、维生素和防晒霜。祝你的大学之路一切顺利！</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p>我们乐意看到顾客运用我们的产品发挥创意。尽情发挥吧！但是请注意，经过微调或改造的宜家产品将丧失其原有功能，或无法进行二次销售，因此，你将不再享有宜家的商业保证及退货权利。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
